# pop'n music 9: the cabinet's shop for e-AMUSEMENT, in test mode > e-AMUSEMENT OPTIONS >
# e-AMUSEMENT SETTINGS: SHOP NAME SETTING "ひらく" (blue 6/4 move down/up, green 7/3 right/left,
# red enters; three lefts from く wrap to the last column, two ups to EXIT), PREFECTURE 東京都
# (hold red, blue x13 from "-"), SAVE AND EXIT. The settings record then holds area 12 (+0x35) and
# the name in Shift-JIS (+0x37), and every call with a shop sends shop_name="82D082E782AD"
# area_num="12" (e.g. p_friend.get after popn9-card-again.his). e-AMUSEMENT must be on already.
#   hiraku-popn9 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn9-shopname.his
game popn9
at 3200 press "Test" 8
at 3320 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3340 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3360 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3380 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3400 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3420 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3440 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3460 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3520 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 3640 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 3800 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3840 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 3960 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 3990 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4020 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4050 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4080 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4110 press "P1 Button 7" 10
at 4140 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4170 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4200 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4230 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4260 press "P1 Button 3" 10
at 4290 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4320 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4350 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4380 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4410 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4440 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4470 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4500 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4530 press "P1 Button 7" 10
at 4560 press "P1 Button 7" 10
at 4590 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4620 press "P1 Button 3" 10
at 4650 press "P1 Button 3" 10
at 4680 press "P1 Button 3" 10
at 4710 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4740 press "P1 Button 4" 10
at 4770 press "P1 Button 5" 10
at 4890 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 4920 hold "P1 Button 5"
at 4940 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 4960 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 4980 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5000 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5020 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5040 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5060 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5080 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5100 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5120 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5140 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5160 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5180 press "P1 Button 6" 8
at 5200 release "P1 Button 5"
at 5230 press "P1 Button 6" 10
at 5260 press "P1 Button 6" 10
